<% this.title = weeklySettings ? '周赛总榜设置' : '周赛总榜' %>
<% include app_header %>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/self/weekly-ranklist.css?rev=20261016-1">
<div class="app-page app-weekly-page" data-weekly-page data-mode="<%= weeklySettings ? 'settings' : 'ranklist' %>">
  <header class="app-page-header"><div class="app-page-heading"><span class="app-kicker">WEEKLY SERIES</span><h1 class="app-page-title" data-weekly-title>周赛总榜</h1><p class="app-page-description" data-weekly-summary>正在读取总榜…</p></div><% if (weeklyManager) { %><div class="app-toolbar-actions"><button type="button" class="app-button app-button-secondary" data-weekly-recalculate><i data-lucide="refresh-cw"></i>全部重算</button></div><% } %></header>
  <nav class="app-tabs" aria-label="周赛总榜"><a href="/weekly-ranklist" class="app-tab <%= weeklySettings ? '' : 'is-active' %>"<% if (!weeklySettings) { %> aria-current="page"<% } %>>总榜</a><% if (weeklyManager) { %><a href="/weekly-ranklist/settings" class="app-tab <%= weeklySettings ? 'is-active' : '' %>"<% if (weeklySettings) { %> aria-current="page"<% } %>>总榜设置</a><% } %></nav>
  <p class="weekly-message" data-weekly-status role="status" hidden></p>
  <details class="weekly-rules"><summary>计分规则与颜色说明</summary><div><p>单场积分 = 100 ×（本人通过题数 ÷ 第一名通过题数）×（2N − 2）÷（N + 名次 − 2）。通过题数相同时按罚时排名，所有参考值均在总榜成员范围内重新计算。零通过得 0 分；仅有一名有效选手时，通过至少一题得 200 分。</p><p><span class="weekly-key weekly-g1">G1</span> 线下成绩最高的四场：S1 为累计分，G1 = S1 ÷ 4，不足四场仍除以 4。<span class="weekly-key weekly-g2">G2</span> 其余场次：S2 为累计分，G2 = S2 ÷ 计入场数；没有其余场次时为 0。</p><p>总分 = 60% × G1 + 40% × G2。超过四场的线下成绩，未进入 G1 的部分也计入 G2。未结束比赛不计分；单元格颜色只表示计分分组，线下参赛另用文字标记。</p><p data-weekly-rules-policy></p></div></details>
  <p class="app-help">实际参赛按赛时未取消的提交或管理员的线下登记确认。仅报名但无提交、也无登记视为缺席；线下到场但零通过仍计一次参赛。</p>
  <% if (weeklySettings) { %>
  <form class="app-form weekly-config" data-weekly-config><label class="app-field"><span class="app-label">总榜名称</span><input class="app-input" name="title" maxlength="100" required></label><label class="app-field"><span class="app-label">单场人数 N</span><select class="app-select" name="population"><option value="all">总榜全部成员</option><option value="solved">总榜中该场至少通过一题的成员</option></select></label><label class="app-field"><span class="app-label">缺席计分</span><select class="app-select" name="count_absent"><option value="true">缺席按 0 分计入 G2 场数</option><option value="false">缺席不计入 G2 场数</option></select></label><button class="app-button app-button-primary" type="submit">保存规则并重算</button></form>
  <div class="app-tabs weekly-settings-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="总榜设置分类"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="is-active" data-weekly-tab="contests">比赛选择</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-weekly-tab="members">成员名单</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-weekly-tab="attendance">线下参赛登记</button></div>
  <section data-weekly-panel="contests"><h2>计分比赛</h2><p class="app-help">搜索比赛名称或编号添加，仅支持 ACM 赛制。增删后全部重算，不影响比赛自身设置、报名或 Rating。所选比赛标题及赛后成绩将展示在总榜。</p><div class="weekly-picker" data-weekly-picker="contests"><label class="app-field"><span class="app-label">搜索比赛</span><input class="app-input" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="比赛名称或编号" aria-label="搜索比赛"></label><div class="weekly-search-results" hidden></div></div><div data-weekly-contests class="weekly-contest-list"></div></section>
  <section data-weekly-panel="members" hidden>
    <h2>总榜成员</h2><p class="app-help">添加已有普通账户；三种方式去重合并，不会创建新账户，也不会替成员报名比赛。</p>
    <div class="weekly-imports">
      <div class="weekly-picker" data-weekly-picker="users"><label class="app-field"><span class="app-label">搜索添加用户</span><input class="app-input" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="用户名、UID、学号或姓名" aria-label="搜索添加用户"></label><div class="weekly-search-results" hidden></div></div>
      <div class="weekly-picker" data-weekly-picker="classes"><label class="app-field"><span class="app-label">从班级导入</span><input class="app-input" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="班级名称或编号" aria-label="搜索班级"></label><div class="weekly-search-results" hidden></div><p class="app-help">按导入时的班级名单添加，班级后续变更不会擅自改动总榜名单。</p></div>
      <form data-weekly-csv class="app-form"><div class="app-field"><span class="app-label" id="weekly-csv-label">学号 CSV 导入</span><label class="app-file-field"><input type="file" name="student_ids_csv" accept=".csv,text/csv" aria-labelledby="weekly-csv-label" aria-describedby="weekly-csv-help" required><span><i data-lucide="file-spreadsheet"></i><strong>选择学号 CSV</strong><small>UTF-8 编码</small><span data-file-selection data-weekly-filename class="app-file-selection" role="status">尚未选择文件</span></span></label><span class="app-help" id="weekly-csv-help">一列十位数字学号，可带“学号”表头；文件内不能重复学号，每次最多 1000 人、1 MiB。</span></div><button class="app-button app-button-primary" type="submit">导入并重算</button></form>
    </div>
    <div class="weekly-toolbar"><input class="app-input" type="search" data-weekly-member-filter placeholder="筛选用户名、学号或姓名" aria-label="筛选成员"><button class="app-button app-button-secondary" type="button" data-weekly-remove-members disabled>移除所选成员</button></div>
    <div class="app-table-region" tabindex="0" aria-label="总榜成员名单"><table class="app-table"><thead><tr><th><input type="checkbox" data-weekly-select-all aria-label="选择当前页全部成员"></th><th>用户名</th><th>姓名</th><th>学号</th><th>已登记线下场数</th></tr></thead><tbody data-weekly-members></tbody></table></div><div class="weekly-pagination" data-weekly-pages="members"></div>
  </section>
  <section data-weekly-panel="attendance" hidden><h2>线下参赛登记</h2><p class="app-help">由管理员核验“机房现场、机房电脑、禁止联网”后勾选对应场次。系统只记录核验结果，不会自动检测参赛地点或联网行为。取消勾选即取消线下标记；已有提交的场次按线上参赛处理。</p><div class="weekly-toolbar"><input class="app-input" type="search" data-weekly-attendance-filter placeholder="筛选用户名、学号或姓名" aria-label="筛选线下登记成员"><button class="app-button app-button-primary" type="button" data-weekly-save-attendance disabled>保存线下记录并重算</button><span class="app-help" data-weekly-attendance-pending></span></div><div class="app-table-region" tabindex="0" aria-label="线下参赛登记表"><table class="app-table weekly-attendance-table"><thead data-weekly-attendance-head></thead><tbody data-weekly-attendance></tbody></table></div><div class="weekly-pagination" data-weekly-pages="attendance"></div></section>
  <% } else { %>
  <div class="app-toolbar weekly-toolbar"><div class="app-toolbar-start"><input class="app-input" type="search" data-weekly-rank-filter placeholder="搜索用户名" aria-label="搜索总榜成员"><span class="weekly-key weekly-g1">计入 G1</span><span class="weekly-key weekly-g2">计入 G2</span></div><% if (weeklyManager) { %><label class="app-switch-control"><input type="checkbox" data-weekly-identities><span class="app-switch-track"></span><span>显示真实信息</span></label><% } %></div>
  <div class="app-table-region weekly-rank-region" tabindex="0" aria-label="周赛总榜"><table class="app-table weekly-rank-table"><thead data-weekly-rank-head></thead><tbody data-weekly-rank></tbody></table></div><div class="weekly-pagination" data-weekly-pages="rank"></div>
  <% } %>
  <p class="app-help weekly-updated" data-weekly-updated></p>
  <dialog class="app-dialog" data-weekly-confirm><form method="dialog"><h2>确认移除</h2><p data-weekly-confirm-text></p><div class="app-form-actions"><button class="app-button app-button-secondary" value="cancel">取消</button><button class="app-button app-button-primary" value="confirm">确认移除</button></div></form></dialog>
</div>
<script src="/self/weekly-ranklist.js?rev=20261018-1" defer></script>
<% include app_footer %>
